        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\">Lord Ashbury</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/4/47/Humanmale_nopic.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20080315075634\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"No image available\"><img alt=\"No image available\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/4/47/Humanmale_nopic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20080315075634\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"267\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Humanmale nopic.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Humanmale_nopic.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nDeceased</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Relative(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Baron_Ashbury\" title=\"Baron Ashbury\">Baron Ashbury</a> (son)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding-right: 1em;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Source#Novels_and_short_stories\" title=\"Source\"><img alt=\"Booknovel\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/21/Booknovel.png/revision/latest?cb=20061113233908\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"67\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Booknovel.png\" data-image-key=\"Booknovel.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #808080; border-bottom: 1px solid #808080; padding: 1ex 1em; margin-top: 0.3ex;\"><small style=\"line-height: 120%;\">This article contains <a href=\"/wiki/Lore\" title=\"Lore\">lore</a> taken from Warcraft <a href=\"/wiki/Novels\" title=\"Novels\">novels</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Novellas\" title=\"Novellas\">novellas</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Short_stories\" title=\"Short stories\">short stories</a>.</small></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lord Ashbury the 1st</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilnean</a> noble and the father of <a href=\"/wiki/Baron_Ashbury\" title=\"Baron Ashbury\">Baron Ashbury</a>. Lord Ashbury helped King <a href=\"/wiki/Archibald_Greymane\" title=\"Archibald Greymane\">Archibald Greymane</a> build Gilneas up to a nation of great power. King Archibald always told his son <a href=\"/wiki/Genn_Greymane\" title=\"Genn Greymane\">Prince Genn</a> to trust in the Ashburys’ fidelity to the crown because of the accomplishments of Lord Ashbury.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:calc(80% + 2.1px);\"><div style=\"margin-top:-0.3em; margin-bottom:0px; height:0px\">&#160;</div><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Lord_of_His_Pack\" title=\"Lord of His Pack\">Lord of His Pack</a></i></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261112120402\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1669/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3977/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 151/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 12/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 342/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 646055/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.734      1 -total\n 80.50%   31.988      1 Template:Npcbox\n 73.08%   29.037      1 Template:Infobox\n 18.03%    7.162      1 Template:Level\n 11.51%    4.575      1 Template:NPC_placeholder_image\n 10.12%    4.020      1 Template:Reflist\n  4.05%    1.611      1 Template:Novel\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_wowpedia:pcache:idhash:311146-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261112120402 and revision id 5592799. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
